=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Nogelle (A)} (K-5) at Conflux #1, who will ask you to retrieve a chunk of {i:Badlands Salt|Badlands Salt|2976}.
** Other types of salt do not work, it must be a {i:Badlands Salt|Badlands Salt|2976} which is {E}.
